    "id": "t03-g053-r2",
    "testId": "test-03",
    "part": 4,
    "title": "A restaurant follow-up call",
    "titleZh": "餐廳的確認電話",
    "topic": "business",
    "passage": "F1: Hello, this is Grace from the Cedar Kitchen about Saturday's lunch. The elevator to the upstairs room is out of service. For your presentation, we can set up a screen in the garden room instead. You can get there without using stairs.\n\nWe can refrigerate your cake if the kitchen staff get it before eleven. Your friend plans to arrive at eleven thirty. She may need to keep the cake with her until serving time.\n\nWe can put food and drinks on separate bills. Individual bills are not available. Tell me which bill should go to your office.",
    "passageZh": "您好，我是 Cedar Kitchen 的 Grace，來電確認星期六的午餐。通往樓上房間的電梯停用了。配合你們的簡報，我們可以改在花園廳設置螢幕，到那裡不用走樓梯。\n\n如果廚房人員在十一點前收到蛋糕，我們可以幫你們冷藏。你的朋友預計十一點半抵達。她可能得先把蛋糕留在身邊，等要上桌時再拿出來。\n\n餐點和飲料可以分開結帳，但不能為每位客人分別開帳單。請告訴我哪一張帳單要寄給你們公司。",
    "audioScript": "Hello, this is Grace from the Cedar Kitchen about Saturday's lunch. The elevator to the upstairs room is out of service. For your presentation, we can set up a screen in the garden room instead. You can get there without using stairs.\n\nWe can refrigerate your cake if the kitchen staff get it before eleven. Your friend plans to arrive at eleven thirty. She may need to keep the cake with her until serving time.\n\nWe can put food and drinks on separate bills. Individual bills are not available. Tell me which bill should go to your office.",
    "turns": [
      {
        "voice": "female",
        "speaker": "F1",
        "text": "Hello, this is Grace from the Cedar Kitchen about Saturday's lunch. The elevator to the upstairs room is out of service. For your presentation, we can set up a screen in the garden room instead. You can get there without using stairs.\n\nWe can refrigerate your cake if the kitchen staff get it before eleven. Your friend plans to arrive at eleven thirty. She may need to keep the cake with her until serving time.\n\nWe can put food and drinks on separate bills. Individual bills are not available. Tell me which bill should go to your office."
      }
    ],
